{"availability":"available","full":"guitarrapc/FeatherQR","name":"FeatherQR","description":"High-performance QR code generator/reader with renderes support","category":"Developer tools","language":"C#","stars":246,"forks":49,"created":"2019-01-16T11:35:48Z","updated":"2026-10-04T05:34:49Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://guitarrapc.github.io/FeatherQR/","topics":["c-sharp","csharp","dotnet","qr-code","qr-code-generator","qrcode","qrcode-generator","skia","skiasharp"],"demo":"https://guitarrapc.github.io/FeatherQR/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:56.035Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:56.035Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:56.035Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:15:56.035Z","stars":246,"forks":49}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["FeatherQR is a lightweight QR Code, Micro QR and rMQR library for .NET. Lightweight means three things: the core package has no dependencies, the hot paths allocate nothing, and every build is trim and NativeAOT safe. It is not a claim about assembly bytes; the core carries three symbologies, decoders and SIMD paths.","FeatherQR generates and decodes module matrices with the BCL alone. FeatherQR.SkiaSharp adds rendering and image decoding with SkiaSharp: PNG, JPEG, WebP and SVG output, canvas rendering, gradients, module shapes, finder patterns and logos. SkiaSharp.QrCode, the name this library shipped under through 1.x, is now an empty package that depends on FeatherQR.SkiaSharp, so an existing install line keeps working.","Benchmark results comparing FeatherQR with other libraries. See src/FeatherQR.Benchmark for details. Above results are generated on .NET 10 with AMD Ryzen 9 7950X3D CPU, with GFNI and AVX2 enabled."],"features":["Simple API: One-liner QR code generation with sensible defaults","High Performance: Optimal speed and minimum memory allocation","Highly Customizable: Gradients, icons, custom shapes, colors, and more","Raster & Vector Output: PNG, JPEG, WebP, and SVG (scales without quality loss)","Cross-Platform: Windows, Linux, macOS, iOS, Android, WebAssembly"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/guitarrapc/FeatherQR/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c121366d4da550a5b4c0747b11ca719ecd015d5a17058edda07d344d2ae0b057","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T06:11:57.718Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T06:11:57.718Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"FeatherQR is a lightweight QR Code, Micro QR and rMQR library for .NET. Lightweight means three things: the core package has no dependencies, the hot paths allocate nothing, and every build is trim and NativeAOT safe. It is not a claim about assembly bytes; the core carries three symbologies, decoders and SIMD paths.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/guitarrapc/FeatherQR/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"c121366d4da550a5b4c0747b11ca719ecd015d5a17058edda07d344d2ae0b057","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/guitarrapc/FeatherQR/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T06:11:57.719Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-04T05:34:49Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/guitarrapc/FeatherQR/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T06:11:57.721Z","hash":"c121366d4da550a5b4c0747b11ca719ecd015d5a17058edda07d344d2ae0b057","originalBytes":57893,"storedBytes":57893,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["var","using","new","version","featherqr","csharp","content","kanji","featherqr.skiasharp","symbol","text","when","code","image","qrecclevel.m","size","skiasharp","default","mode","qrcodegenerator.create","modules","pngbytes","micro","one","module","see","out","qrcodeimagebuilder","rmqr","standard","svg","byte","ecc","withsize","only","qrcodegeneratoroptions","any","canvas","utf-8","core","does","fit","height","net","same","single","every","library","logo","output","support","tobytearray","witherrorcorrection","bits","data","decode","icons","qrcode","qrecclevel.h","segmenta